DTSTAMP:20260806T022510Z
UID:ec64e83e-20a2-4dfe-846f-a2e180647b7b
DTSTART:20260921T120000
DTEND:20260927T210000
DESCRIPTION:Build a Windsor Continuous Arm Chair with chair maker and SBWI 
 founder Luke Barnett. Spend 7 days immersed in the world of green woodwork
 ing\, as we start with logs on Monday morning and finish with a continuous
  armchair on Saturday. Class will run through Sunday if you upgrade to a W
 indsor continuous rocking chair or need a little extra time with your side
  chair.
SUMMARY:Windsor Continuous Arm Chair
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0Hu000000TbxQKAS
END:VEVENT
